	(descr "Bel Fuse 2250504-1 (0826-1X1T-KH-F) 1x1 2.5GBASE-T 100W 4-pair PoE MagJack ICM, THT tab-up, no LEDs. GEOMETRY RE-VERIFIED Task 14b by vector-extracting the SUGGESTED PCB FOOTPRINT view of TRP/Bel drawing C=2250504 Rev1 (dr-mag-2250504-1.pdf, fetched from belfuse.com) at 11.34 PDF-units/mm and cross-checking 8 printed dimensions (2.032/1.016 pitches, 11.18 VC span, 8.13/6.59 VC rows, 12.7 peg span, 16.13 shield span, 3.18 peg-to-shield, 8.17 CL-to-slot-edge) -- all matched exactly. Fixes vs Task-14 approximation: VC pins moved from x=+/-3.09 to drawing-true x=+/-5.588 with 1.543mm row separation (was 1.27); signal row 1-6 is UNIFORM 2.032 pitch -1..6 at x=-5.08..+5.08 (old version wrongly put the center gap in this row and pushed pins 3/2/1 out to +7.112); shield slots at y 4.291mm below row 7-12 (was 5.7); locating pegs 17.78mm below row 7-12 (was 21.56 -- 3.78mm error); shield pin holes Ø1.57 3.175mm below pegs at x=+/-8.065. Pin numbering read directly off the drawing (rows: 12..7 top / 6..1, VC 14/16 left, 13/15 right). Body outline/courtyard are approximate cosmetic envelope (16.8 x ~22 body). 3D model: dimensioned envelope box (16.8x21.8x13.7mm), not a detailed body.")
